lightning but my second monk is doing well.  She's solved Sobokan (BoH)
and gotten to Minetown where's she set up a stash and acquired not one
but two magic lamps.

Unfortunately I don't have holy water but when I get some I'll wish up
a CoMR and something else.

This monk is a rule breaker.  My last monk was armorless, vegan except
for the time he slipped and ate a lizard, and weaponless.

This monk isn't any of those.  She's wearing studded leather armor and
kicking to avoid the "Your armor is cumbersome" message.  This has
worked out well except for the gold golem and croc in Minetown which
seem to be invincible.  But she's got sleep and can outrun them.  She's
eating meat when it grants resistances and I didn't even know Wraiths
were meat.  That's pretty weird, but ok.

